        <dl class="dl-horizontal">

            <dt>Concept UI</dt><dd>M0011233</dd>

            
                <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>The state or condition of being a human individual accorded moral and/or legal rights. Criteria to be used to determine this status are subject to debate, and range from the requirement of simply being a human organism to such requirements as that the individual be self-aware and capable of rational thought and moral agency.</dd>
            

